{
  "page": {
    "name": "智能体编辑",
    "parent": "bot/agent/agent/list",
    "type": 2,
    "sort": 10,
    "auth": [
      {
        "key": "bot/agent/agent/create",
        "name": "智能体新增",
        "query": {
          "id": "empty"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "bot/agent/agent/update",
        "name": "智能体编辑",
        "query": {
          "id": "required"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "layout": {
    "type": "container",
    "children": {
      "page-main": {
        "type": "main",
        "className": "p-0",
        "children": {
          "tabs-row": {
            "type": "container",
            "className": "mb-4"
          },
          "dialog-shell": {
            "type": "container",
            "className": "w-full"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "nodes": {
    "tabs-row": [
      {
        "type": "nav-tab",
        "meta": {
          "target": "state.currentTab",
          "variant": "line",
          "tabs": [
            {
              "label": "基础信息",
              "value": "basic"
            },
            {
              "label": "设定",
              "value": "setting"
            },
            {
              "label": "运行配置",
              "value": "runtime"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "dialog-shell": [
      {
        "type": "form-select",
        "value": "form.cate_id",
        "mode": "form",
        "option": {
          "service": "bot.agent.setting.OptionService.LoadAgentCates"
        },
        "validate": [
          {
            "type": "required",
            "message": "智能体分类不能为空。"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "basic",
          "controlClassName": "max-w-[260px]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-input",
        "placeholder": "例如：图生图智能体",
        "value": "form.name",
        "mode": "form",
        "validate": [
          {
            "type": "required",
            "message": "智能体名称不能为空。"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "basic"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "agent-key-editable",
        "type": "form-input",
        "name": "标识",
        "placeholder": "可留空，保存时自动生成",
        "value": "form.key",
        "mode": "form",
        "info": "用于系统调用和跨环境稳定定位，建议使用小写字母、数字和中划线。",
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "basic",
          "hiddenWhen": [
            {
              "path": "form.kind",
              "operator": "equals",
              "value": "internal"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "agent-key-internal",
        "type": "form-input",
        "name": "标识",
        "value": "form.key",
        "mode": "form",
        "info": "系统内置智能体的标识不可修改。",
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "basic",
          "disabled": true,
          "showWhen": [
            {
              "path": "form.kind",
              "operator": "equals",
              "value": "internal"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-textarea",
        "placeholder": "描述这个智能体负责什么事情。",
        "value": "form.description",
        "mode": "form",
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "basic",
          "rows": 3
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-select",
        "placeholder": "请选择 Energon 中的 LLM 能力",
        "value": "form.llm_power_id",
        "mode": "form",
        "option": {
          "service": "bot.agent.setting.OptionService.LoadTextPowers"
        },
        "info": "第一阶段 Agent 直接通过这个 LLM 能力调用 Energon。",
        "validate": [
          {
            "type": "required",
            "message": "LLM能力不能为空。"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "setting",
          "controlClassName": "max-w-[360px]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-select",
        "name": "知识库分类",
        "placeholder": "不使用知识库",
        "value": "form.knowledge_cate_id",
        "mode": "form",
        "option": {
          "service": "bot.agent.setting.OptionService.LoadKnowledgeCates"
        },
        "info": "选择后，智能体可以读取该分类下所有启用的知识库；留空则不挂载知识库。",
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "setting",
          "controlClassName": "max-w-[260px]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-select",
        "name": "技能方案",
        "placeholder": "不使用技能",
        "value": "form.skill_pack_id",
        "mode": "form",
        "option": {
          "model": "bot.agent.NewSkillPackModel",
          "filters": {
            "status": 1
          },
          "order": "sort asc,id asc"
        },
        "info": "选择后加载该方案中的启用技能；留空则不挂载技能。",
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "setting",
          "controlClassName": "max-w-[260px]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-editor",
        "name": "设定",
        "placeholder": "填写智能体的身份、职责、边界和工作要求。",
        "value": "form.prompt",
        "mode": "form",
        "info": "运行时会先读取智能体分类的公共提示词，再追加这里的智能体设定。",
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "vertical",
          "tab": "setting",
          "minHeight": 320,
          "maxHeight": 560
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-number",
        "placeholder": "0-2，建议 0.2-1.0",
        "value": "form.temperature",
        "mode": "form",
        "info": "控制 LLM 输出随机性。0 更稳定、2 更发散；默认 0.7，通常不要超过 1。",
        "validate": [
          {
            "type": "min",
            "min": 0,
            "message": "温度不能小于 0。"
          },
          {
            "type": "max",
            "max": 2,
            "message": "温度不能大于 2。"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "runtime",
          "controlClassName": "max-w-[160px]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-number",
        "placeholder": "单位：秒，10-3600",
        "value": "form.timeout_seconds",
        "mode": "form",
        "info": "单次运行的总超时时间，单位是秒。超过后运行应停止并记录失败/超时，默认 3600 秒。",
        "validate": [
          {
            "type": "min",
            "min": 10,
            "message": "超时时间不能小于 10 秒。"
          },
          {
            "type": "max",
            "max": 3600,
            "message": "超时时间不能大于 3600 秒。"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "runtime",
          "controlClassName": "max-w-[160px]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-number",
        "placeholder": "0 表示继承全局默认",
        "value": "form.max_auto_steps",
        "mode": "form",
        "info": "控制本智能体单次运行最多自动决策多少步；0 表示继承全局默认，实际不会超过全局强制最大步骤数。",
        "validate": [
          {
            "type": "min",
            "min": 0,
            "message": "最大自动步骤数不能小于 0。"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "tab": "runtime",
          "controlClassName": "max-w-[180px]"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "data": {
    "form": {
      "id": 0,
      "cate_id": 1,
      "name": "",
      "key": "",
      "kind": "normal",
      "description": "",
      "prompt": "",
      "llm_power_id": "",
      "knowledge_cate_id": "",
      "skill_pack_id": "",
      "temperature": 0.7,
      "timeout_seconds": 3600,
      "max_auto_steps": 0
    }
  },
  "state": {
    "currentTab": "basic"
  },
  "action": {
    "submit": {
      "type": "save",
      "params": "form",
      "before": {
        "service": "bot.agent.setting.AgentHook.BeforeSaveAgent"
      }
    }
  }
}
